            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "The three single roots give\n$$f(x)=k(x+2)(x-1)(x-3).$$\nUsing $f(0)=12$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\nk(2)(-1)(-3)&=12\\\\\n6k&=12\\\\\nk&=2.\n\\end{align*}$$\nHence,\n$$f(x)=2(x+2)(x-1)(x-3).$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
